OL,3,GNEWSAMotion calls for more education on
OL,4,Ae-scooter risks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city councillor is calling for a
OL,7,Fpublic-awareness campaign and tougher
OL,8,Fenforcement to tackle the illegal use
OL,9,Fof privately owned e-scooters.
OL,11,FIvelina Banyalieva, Conservative
OL,12,Fcouncillor for Peterborough's Paston
OL,13,Fand Walton ward, says e-scooter
OL,14,Foffences are "increasingly normalised".
OL,15,FShe said she had seen parents taking
OL,16,Fchildren to school on them and workers
OL,17,Fcommuting on them.
