OL,3,GNEWSAMotion calls for more education on
OL,4,Ae-scooter risks
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has proposed a motion which seeks
OL,7,Fclarity from Cambridgeshire Police on
OL,8,Fhow officers respond when e-scooter
OL,9,Flawbreaking is spotted and calls for
OL,10,Fmore visible enforcement at hotspots.
OL,12,FBetween April 2025 and March 2026,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire Police seized more than
OL,14,F450 e-scooters, 126 e-bikes and issued
OL,15,Fabout 180 fines.
